  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protecting the peace: Dealing with the past and safeguarding the future in Eastern Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;The main objective of the action is to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;promote sustained and inclusive peace and reconciliation efforts in Ethiopia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;. To achieve this, the specific objectives of the action are to: 1. Increase the capacity of the Somali Truth and Reconciliation Commission (TRC) to deliver its mandate in a gender sensitive and victim centred way; and 2. To better understand, prevent and respond to conflict drivers, dynamics and impacts resulting from the Memorandum of understanding (MoU) between Ethiopia and Somaliland in Eastern regions of Ethiopia.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
